      "value": "@{5b8f33ea6d8cbb0cbea80416|full_name}: yeah i agree sometimes i find that as well, current problem im having with this current set up is when i have both toggles on, it turns off both toggled on states when i turn one back off even though i have given both of them different exit state values this would be great if they could add a enable value field and a disable value field in the expression menu control.\nalso managed to get it to work with 2 parameters(a enable Parameter and disable parameter) but not as toggles but as buttons since from my testing since it seems to reset both regardless if the conditions were met",
