      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I would give my life for the ability to specify exit values, I've been attempting to do multiple independent toggles in one animator and while I assume there is a way to do it if you're good with unity, I'm an amateur at best.\nMy very basic and user friendly suggestion would be the ability to specify the exit value as well as the entrance value on the Control menu, like the bad edit attached to my post.\nI have no idea if this is even feasible, but something like it would be useful.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
